      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "力与物体质量的关系."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**我们把 $9.8$ 牛顿/千克这个量用一个字母 $g$ 来表示：",
        "$g=9.8$ 牛顿/千克，**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是就可以写出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$F=gm$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式中 $F$——重力，以牛顿为单位；$m$——质量，以千克为单位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们已经知道，物体因地球的吸引而作用于支承物或悬",
        "挂物上的力叫做物体的重量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**如果支承物是水平放置的，且相对于地球是静止不动的，",
        "则物体的重量就与重力相等.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在本书中，以后凡是谈到物体的重量时，指的都是施于水",
        "平放置的静止支承物上的重量. 因此，以牛顿做为单位来表",
        "示的物体的重量 $P$，也就可以用公式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$P=gm$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "来计算，式中的质量 $m$ 要以千克为单位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "进行计算时，在许多情况下都可以只取整数，而认为质量",
        "是 $0.1$ 千克即 $100$ 克的物体上所受的重力是 $1$ 牛顿. 这样，",
        "$1$ 千克质量的物体所受的重力就近似等于 $10$ 牛顿，而 $500$ 克",
        "的物体所受的重力就近似等于 $5$ 牛顿，等等."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
